* TR-1um IP62 RF engineering model manifest.
*
* Select this file instead of ip62_models_calibrated to get the RF overlays.
* The OS00-calibrated baseline is included unchanged -- none of its files are
* modified.  Every overlay here is additive: it defines new subcircuits or
* models with distinct names and leaves the baseline devices alone.
*
* Contents
*   models_IP62_mos_rf.lib       NMOS_nf / PMOS_nf  multi-finger MOS
*   models_IP62_cap_rf.lib       F_CSIO_rf          plate ESR + substrate loss
*   models_IP62_res_rf.lib       F_RS_rf            parasitic C + RC ladder
*   models_IP62_varactor.lib     NMOS_var / PMOS_var / DP_var / DN_var
*   models_IP62_inductor.lib     IND_PI             pi-model template
*
* Engineering status: all of these are first-pass models built from geometry
* and existing calibrated laws.  The placeholders are called out in each file
* header (gate-poly sheet resistance, plate ESR, substrate conductivity,
* abrupt-junction grading).  Do not quote Q, ft or fmax from them as silicon
* data.
*
* The spiral inductor subckts themselves are produced per geometry by
*   python3 flow/scripts/gen_inductor_model.py --turns 4 --d-out 250 \
*           --width 8 --spacing 3 --name IND_4T_250U
* which writes a subckt that instantiates IND_PI.
*
.include ip62_models_calibrated
.include models_IP62_mos_rf.lib
.include models_IP62_cap_rf.lib
.include models_IP62_res_rf.lib
.include models_IP62_varactor.lib
.include models_IP62_inductor.lib
